WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.263 --> 00:00:01.815
- [Narrator] A sun salutation

00:00:01.815 --> 00:00:04.196
is a series of continuous yoga poses

00:00:04.196 --> 00:00:08.044
to improve your strength
and your flexibility.

00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:10.039
Bring your hands to heart center

00:00:10.039 --> 00:00:11.896
and set an intention, such as,

00:00:11.896 --> 00:00:14.711
I am love, or, I will be strong.

00:00:14.711 --> 00:00:16.788
Raise your arms towards the ceiling

00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:18.628
and ground down through your feet.

00:00:18.628 --> 00:00:21.233
Mountain Pose is a foundational pose.

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:24.510
Hinge at your hips, bring
your fingertips to the floor,

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.698
and keep a slight bend in your knees.

00:00:26.698 --> 00:00:29.074
This is Forward Fold.

00:00:29.074 --> 00:00:33.105
Bring your fingertips to your
shins and flatten your back.

00:00:33.105 --> 00:00:36.605
Halfway Lift Pose is a pose for alignment.

00:00:39.102 --> 00:00:41.486
Make sure your wrists
and elbows are in line,

00:00:41.486 --> 00:00:43.805
arms by your sides, bring your knees

00:00:43.805 --> 00:00:46.638
to the floor, and then lower down.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:52.007
This is modified Chaturanga
Pose for strengthening.

00:00:53.361 --> 00:00:56.368
Put your hips towards
the sky and press back.

00:00:56.368 --> 00:00:58.868
This is a Downward-Facing Dog.

00:01:00.136 --> 00:01:02.358
Step your feet towards your hands,

00:01:02.358 --> 00:01:06.105
hang for a moment, then
come back to Mountain Pose,

00:01:06.105 --> 00:01:08.717
and bring your palms to heart center.

00:01:08.717 --> 00:01:12.050
(soothing upbeat music)

00:01:22.707 --> 00:01:25.457
(metal creaking)

